<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24838" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῐαίνω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδίηνα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wet, moisten,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερῴην δ᾽ οὐκ ἐδίηνε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.495
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμμα διῆναι</span> Heliod.Med(?).ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.36.8
			</span></i> (hex.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαίνετο . . ἄξων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					13.30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ διαίνων ἔντερ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Axionic.
					8.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαίνεσθαι ὄσσε</span>
			<i>wet one's</i> eyes, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1064
			</span></i> (lyr.): and abs., <i>weep,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				258
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίαινε πῆμα.</span> Ans.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαίνομαι</span>
			<i>weep for</i> the woe—I <i>weep,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1038
			</span></i> (lyr.), cf. Sch.ad loc., <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				210.35
			</span></i>.—Rare in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				387a28
			</span></i>.</div>
